id: og_reserve
name: Reserve Collection
description: Reserve Collection. A lit gallery over the crated store the gallery came out of, so the same objects are on show upstairs and stacked on pallets underneath. Built as a museum and its reserve store; the collection was being packed for a move when the building was closed.

